  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>, then the ordered pair&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
