  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
